ygjson records facts about Yu-Gi-Oh! cards and products: names, passcodes, types, attributes, levels, ATK/DEF,
rarities, set numbers, which set each print comes from, and which TCGplayer product is which print. No effect text,
product descriptions or card art is copied into the data. Images in the data are links to YGOPRODeck and Yugipedia,
not copies.

The facts come from YGOPRODeck (https://ygoprodeck.com/api-guide/), YGOJSON
(https://github.com/iconmaster5326/YGOJSON, MIT), Yugipedia (https://yugipedia.com, whose text is CC BY-SA 4.0) and
TCGplayer's catalogue as mirrored by TCGCSV (https://tcgcsv.com).

Yu-Gi-Oh! and its marks belong to Kazuki Takahashi/Shueisha and Konami. ygjson is not affiliated with them.
